// 4xAA 6 V alkaline battery pack (four Energizer E91 / IEC LR6 cells in series in a 4-cell holder).
// Thevenin model: 6.0 V open-circuit EMF (4 * 1.5 V) in series with 0.9 ohm fresh internal
// resistance (4 * 0.225 ohm, midpoint of Energizer E91's 150 to 300 mohm fresh DC effective
// resistance; Energizer's Battery Internal Resistance Technical Bulletin v1.1.0 p1 measures
// 0.214 ohm on a fresh AA cell). Current warns past 500 mA, the highest continuous load
// plotted on Energizer E91 (0.25 s time constant from its 0.25 s High Rate Toy pulse).
